{
 "id": "6782b717-439a-4278-b425-f1173ee5f9eb",
 "type": "manga",
 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "I Found a Family That Wasn't in My Adoption Plan"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ko": "입양 플랜에는 없던 가족이 생겼다"
   },
   {
    "ko-ro": "Ibyang Plan-eneun Eopdeon Gajogi Saenggyeotda"
   },
   {
    "en": "This Wasn't in My Adoption Plan!"
   },
   {
    "th": "ครอบครัวผิดแผน"
   },
   {
    "zh": "有了不在领养计划里的家人"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Once a brilliant secretary of the Brauno family, I was betrayed and killed by an assassin. Reborn as Aerin, the seven-year-old illegitimate granddaughter of the same family, I discovered my new fate was to be adopted by the very man who orchestrated my death. Determined to avoid this, I planned to find a new family. But instead of just adoption, unexpected riches, honor, and powerful alliances started falling into my lap. Will I rise above my past and seize control of not just the family but the entire empire?\n\n---\nShe was the most competent secretary of the Brauno family, the most prestigious in the empire, but one day, she was betrayed and killed by a hitman…!\n\nWas it because of the resentment she faced for not being a noble? Or because of her desire to become one?\n\nShe reincarnated as Aerin, the seven-year-old illegitimate granddaughter of the Brauno family!!\n\nHowever, even as this child, she’s destined to be adopted and killed by the same man who betrayed her in her previous life.\n\nNo way! Before I die by his hands, I’ll get adopted by someone else!\n\nHuh? All I wanted was to be adopted, but now…\n\nWealth, honor, and even a new family that wasn’t part of the adoption plan come as a package deal.\n\n“Aerin! Take me!”\n\n“No, I already have too much….”\n\n“It’s fine if you just add me to your endless list of assets.”\n\n“But how could I possibly take in a prince…?”\n\nAt this point, should I just take over not only the family but the entire empire too?"
  },
